//
// CBM-4（AUTOLOOP-PI-GRAPH-CBM4-1）— Governed Production Memory Write-back:
// controlled-lifecycle self-closeout.
//
// The card's OWN bundle is generated by the PRODUCTION Graph closeout hook
//（runSubagentGraph → runColimaGraph → runMandatoryGraphCloseout →
// runCloseoutGate）: SA-R1 ‖ SA-R2 -> SA-W1 -> SA-V1, writer -> independent
// review agent -> bounded repair（budget 1）-> verifier.
//
// The graph runs WITH write-back enabled（dogfooding CBM-4 on the real
// production Graph path — the closeout graph's own PASS outcome becomes the
// FIRST production memory write-back, telemetry-observed）and with the COST-1
// telemetry observer.
//
// Run: node scripts/cbm4-self-closeout.mjs
//      node scripts/cbm4-self-closeout.mjs --regenerate（reuses the session's
//      graph-closeout evidence; no colima re-run）

